{"id":"activity_oscar_buteyko_breathing","name":"Buteyko Breathing","category":"Breathwork","subcategory":"Breathwork","domain":"wellness","type":"canonical","verb":"Breathe","lane_subcategory":"Breathwork","is_active":true,"intensity":"low","description":"Gentle nasal breathing with short, comfortable pauses after the breath out.","duration_minutes":5,"default_duration_min":5,"steps":[{"order":1,"title":"Sit comfortably","instruction":"Sit upright and relaxed."},{"order":2,"title":"Breathe gently","instruction":"Breathe quietly through your nose."},{"order":3,"title":"Pause briefly","instruction":"After a normal breath out, take a short, comfortable pause. It should never feel like a struggle."},{"order":4,"title":"Resume","instruction":"Return to quiet nasal breathing and let the breath settle before the next cycle."}],"instructions":"1. Sit upright and relaxed.\n2. Breathe quietly through your nose.\n3. After a normal breath out, take a short, comfortable pause. It should never feel like a struggle.\n4. Return to quiet nasal breathing and let the breath settle before the next cycle.","safety_notes":"Never push the pause to discomfort. Do not practise breath-holds in water, while driving or standing. Stop if you feel dizzy, anxious or short of breath.","contraindications":["Asthma, heart or lung conditions: ask your clinician first","Pregnancy (avoid breath-holds)","Dizziness or fainting while practising","Uncontrolled asthma: follow your own action plan"],"benefits":{"primary":"Teaches slow, quiet nasal breathing","secondary":["Calmer breathing pattern"]},"health_benefits":["Teaches slow, quiet nasal breathing","Calmer breathing pattern"],"tags":["oscar patel","breathing","buteyko"],"body_parts":["nose","diaphragm","mouth"],"recommended_duration":"Archived: 5–10 cycles","recommended_frequency":"Daily","recommended_intensity":"Comfortable and pain-free","tips":"Described in Oscar Patel's public materials as compiled on 25 October 2026 from his website, videos, social posts and an unverified community document; the steps are a practical adaptation, not word-for-word instructions.","is_group":false,"is_prenatal":false,"target_gender":["all"],"target_age_min":18,"sort_order":371},
