{"id":"activity_oscar_lateral_lunge_with_reach","name":"Lateral Lunge with Reach","category":"Fitness","subcategory":"Warm-up and movement","domain":"fitness","type":"canonical","verb":"Lunge","lane_subcategory":"Strength","is_active":true,"intensity":"moderate","description":"A wide sideways lunge combined with an easy diagonal or overhead reach.","duration_minutes":3,"default_duration_min":3,"steps":[{"order":1,"title":"Step wide","instruction":"Take a wide step out to the side."},{"order":2,"title":"Sit into the stepping leg","instruction":"Bend the stepping knee and shift your hips back, keeping the other leg comparatively straight."},{"order":3,"title":"Reach","instruction":"Reach diagonally or overhead without forcing your spine."},{"order":4,"title":"Return","instruction":"Push back to standing and repeat on the other side."}],"instructions":"1. Take a wide step out to the side.\n2. Bend the stepping knee and shift your hips back, keeping the other leg comparatively straight.\n3. Reach diagonally or overhead without forcing your spine.\n4. Push back to standing and repeat on the other side.","safety_notes":"Keep the knee tracking over the toes and go only as deep as is comfortable.","contraindications":["Acute injury, or pain that sharpens with the movement","Dizziness or balance problems (use a wall or chair for support)","Recent surgery, unless your clinician has cleared it","Knee or groin pain in a wide stance"],"benefits":{"primary":"Mobilises the hips and inner thighs while reaching","secondary":["Leg strength","Side-to-side stability"]},"health_benefits":["Mobilises the hips and inner thighs while reaching","Leg strength","Side-to-side stability"],"tags":["oscar patel","lunge","hip mobility"],"body_parts":["legs","adductors","glutes","hip_flexors"],"recommended_duration":"10 reps (alternating sides)","recommended_frequency":"Daily, as a warm-up","recommended_intensity":"Comfortable and pain-free","tips":"Described in Oscar Patel's public materials as compiled on 25 October 2026 from his website, videos, social posts and an unverified community document; the steps are a practical adaptation, not word-for-word instructions.","is_group":false,"is_prenatal":false,"target_gender":["all"],"target_age_min":18,"sort_order":303},
