{"id":"activity_oscar_static_back","name":"Static Back","category":"Recovery","subcategory":"Spine and posture","domain":"wellness","type":"canonical","verb":"Rest","lane_subcategory":"Rest","is_active":true,"intensity":"low","description":"A supported lying position with the lower legs on a chair, used to relax the spine.","duration_minutes":5,"default_duration_min":5,"steps":[{"order":1,"title":"Lie down","instruction":"Lie on your back."},{"order":2,"title":"Legs on a chair","instruction":"Rest your lower legs on a chair or bench."},{"order":3,"title":"Right angles","instruction":"Bend your hips and knees to roughly 90 degrees."},{"order":4,"title":"Arms out","instruction":"Rest your arms out to the sides, palms up."},{"order":5,"title":"Breathe and let go","instruction":"Breathe comfortably and let the body relax."}],"instructions":"1. Lie on your back.\n2. Rest your lower legs on a chair or bench.\n3. Bend your hips and knees to roughly 90 degrees.\n4. Rest your arms out to the sides, palms up.\n5. Breathe comfortably and let the body relax.","safety_notes":"Come out slowly, rolling to one side. Stop if it causes pain or numbness.","contraindications":["Acute back or hip pain that worsens in this position","Late pregnancy (lying flat on the back)","Dizziness when lying down"],"benefits":{"primary":"Supported spinal relaxation with the legs raised","secondary":["Lower-back release","Calm breathing"]},"health_benefits":["Supported spinal relaxation with the legs raised","Lower-back release","Calm breathing"],"tags":["oscar patel","spine","relaxation"],"body_parts":["lower_back","spine","hip_flexors"],"equipment_needed":["chair or bench"],"equipment":["chair or bench"],"recommended_duration":"Not specified by Oscar; 3–5 minutes is a comfortable start","recommended_frequency":"Daily or as needed","recommended_intensity":"Comfortable and pain-free","tips":"Described in Oscar Patel's public materials as compiled on 25 October 2026 from his website, videos, social posts and an unverified community document; the steps are a practical adaptation, not word-for-word instructions.","is_group":false,"is_prenatal":false,"target_gender":["all"],"target_age_min":18,"sort_order":323},
